## Load dictConfig

```python
import logging
import logging.config

from app.core import settings
from app.utils import read_yaml

LOGGING_CONFIG = read_yaml(settings.logging.config_path)
logging.config.dictConfig(LOGGING_CONFIG)
```

## config/logging.yaml

```yaml
version: 1
disable_existing_loggers: False

formatters:
    simple:
        (): app.logging.formatters.BaseFormatter
        settings:
            module: True

    colorized:
        (): app.logging.formatters.ColorisedFormatter
        settings:
            module: True
            log_path: True

    colorized.module:
        (): app.logging.formatters.ColorisedFormatter
        settings:
            module: True

handlers:
    console:
        class: logging.StreamHandler
        level: DEBUG
        formatter: colorized
        stream: ext://sys.stdout

    console.module:
        class: logging.StreamHandler
        level: DEBUG
        formatter: colorized.module
        stream: ext://sys.stdout

    file:
        class: logging.FileHandler
        level: INFO
        formatter: simple
        filename: LOGGING.LOG

loggers:
    uvicorn:
        level: INFO
        handlers: [console.module, file]

    alembic:
        level: INFO
        handlers: [console.module, file]

    app:
        level: INFO
        handlers: [console, file]

    app.api:
        level: ERROR
```

